      "id": "claim_f623fdf4ab0c491e9f8723f2846b8a99",
      "statement": "The two orienting invariants for any change are that files are the source of truth with the index a disposable rebuildable projection, and that commit_note is the single sanctioned write — git-first, guarded, gated, and audited — with everything else routed through an owner-approved proposal.",
