    {
      "id": "claim_ca432fecb3f6465d9354ad8d05a913a9",
      "statement": "The gates that define done are the five commands CI's lint-test-license job runs after syncing dev extras — ruff, check_version_consistency.py, pytest, license_scan.py, and preflight_public_scan.py — and all five must pass before a change is done; CONTRIBUTING.md expects the whole loop to fit under five minutes on a Linux runner with the suite the only step measured in minutes, while AGENTS.md warns the I/O-bound suite can take about 15 minutes and must not be mistaken for a hang. A second CI job installs the built wheel with no lockfile to prove a fresh user install still starts.",
