    {
      "id": "claim_8b7d5766300645559c24ef22c16e3b6e",
      "statement": "`hypermnesic local-proof` — installed with `uv tool install hypermnesic` — is the shortest path to proving recall: against an existing markdown git repository it validates the vault, builds the projection, answers a natural question with its repo-relative source path, and previews a write as a dry-run diff with no commit, creating only the disposable index projection and provisioning no endpoints or clients; it works with no API key, and `--demo-dir` generates a tiny git-backed demo vault instead.",
