      "id": "claim_7100133b7fbd44a4b9d983c063daaf22",
      "statement": "The layer cycle is closed and directional: the git-tracked markdown vault is projected into the disposable index, the read path converges and retrieves from that projection, serving exposes both the read tools and the gated write, and `commit_note` returns the cycle to the vault as a git commit.",
