      "id": "claim_f517025ac6384e1e9438b22b81d88bf5",
      "statement": "`hypermnesic` is the engine-host-local command surface: `build_parser()` registers the subcommands and `main()` dispatches to the handler each leaf parser set as `func`, it runs on the host that owns the vault and the disposable index, and it calls the same domain modules the MCP server calls — so each CLI verb and its MCP tool counterpart must be kept in step. `local-proof` is only one of those verbs.",
